  "ingredients": [
    "8 potatoes, peeled and quartered",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "salt to taste",
    "1/3 cup unsalted butter",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "1 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "1 pinch ground white pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sAUHSVamr-uBN_wq6meC9H888Kw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18290-garlic-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-step1-4x3-0281-e6da85e8cb96444b9e8d3168affff529.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18290/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine potatoes, garlic, and 1 tablespoon salt in a medium saucepan with enough water to cover potatoes by 1 inch; bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce heat to medium-low; simmer until potatoes are fork-tender, 10 to 12 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C6D9aHNz5YmU4GJ-kfVGOkYe_dY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18290-garlic-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-step2-4x3-0281-983343bb987346ac84118eaca787ce22.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18290/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain potatoes. Return to hot saucepan; stir until dry, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7TQBt-iiXbCu9oEMJt6k9lwbbxM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18290-garlic-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-step3-4x3-0281-f9866567116e4954959c7acaac3d5a8e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18290/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add butter, 1 piece at a time, stirring gently until melted before adding more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_Tb4o7glD5qFqARaoP8zkzvDoVs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18290-garlic-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-step4-4x3-0281-0ff80553ab0a40ae997dcf9780b87805.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18290/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash in milk using a potato masher until smooth. Stir in 1 teaspoon salt and white pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DKcTcxJOd2Tp_aUq7jH1nb7mMh8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18290-garlic-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-step5-4x3-0300-da52e27ee9e741a4a00beb216cb15a15.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18290/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer potatoes to a serving bowl; top with more butter, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XqaOvL2IlOsJ_APMS9SLpfuuWAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18290-garlic-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-step6-4x3-0301-07b2513a88154f57988781d08838a99e.jpg"
